  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Food Security and Livelihoods (FSL) Sector coordination platforms at central and state levels, increasing immediate food access and restoring the productive capacities of vulnerable farming and pastoral households</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the proposed project is to strengthen the FSL Sector coordination mechanism, and support vulnerable households in producing their own food, generating income and coping with future shocks through restoring and improving their productive assets</narrative>
  </description>
